{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:20 2026-11-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:20 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:20 2026-11-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"巴西龜墮樓重創不治，警拘捕一名男子。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/640727abd0c71b8df991f5d82712e5aa/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_23_39.jpeg\"/><p>深水埗富昌邨發生墮龜慘劇。今日(18日)接近中午12時，保安員在富韻樓對開發現一隻巴西龜倒臥地面，奄奄一息，龜殼爆裂，懷疑由高處墮下，報警求助。警員接報到場，經檢驗後證實巴西龜當場死亡，將案件列虐待動物跟進，其後警員登樓調查，在樓上一單位拘捕一名男住客，懷疑有人掟龜落街。</p><img alt=\"警員在樓上單位拘捕一名男住客涉虐待動物。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ec3d3d046cd67ed988205f64fa7a8575/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_23_40.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"巴西龜疑由高處墮地慘死。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dbabad46003df03470c768240bbdac76/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_02_57.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員登樓調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8c914b5f9b75030ce755415db9262c4a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_02_56_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cf842cd8a4e6e727affe26891d2f7629/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_02_55_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"愛協人員到場檢驗龜屍。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0ee275af6ec0f40be544b36822c93292/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_02_54_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ef22faa8bea5a3bfd4767df633c3c5d4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_02_54.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"龜殼爆裂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1f4c49ee7c91f167181364a254be376e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_02_53_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"愛協檢驗巴西龜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2ed5c5b4982ce628e935f79eeb25206a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_02_52.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8fc891c275b37dc77d9a385c011c099c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_02_52_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場休憩公園正進行維修被圍封。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4c41d084b295a5cc7655925ce05d53e3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_02_58.jpeg\"/><p>現場為富韻樓對開休憩公園，房署正進行維修，附近一帶均被圍封。墮下的巴西龜直徑約長8吋，龜殼爆裂，並有血迹。警員登樓調查，愛護動物協會人員亦到場，將龜屍檢走。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:07:19.146215+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T08:17:28.753329+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:00:47.723598+00:00","content_hash":"8126ecc54639e56073e63adf952089eeb516ddad8642ba824f29998be1acb0eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}